Cover Studio
Copyright 2026 Cover Studio contributors

Cover Studio is an independent user interface and integration for YuE2.
Music generation is powered by YuE2 from the YuE project and its contributors:
https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE
https://map-yue2.github.io/

Native inference is provided by audio.cpp and its contributors:
https://github.com/0xShug0/audio.cpp
The compatible fork containing this project's Vulkan fixes is:
https://github.com/pkircher29/audio.cpp

Melody transcription uses SheetSage2 and MERT-v2-FullSong from M-A-P.
Lyrics transcription uses Qwen3-ASR from the Qwen team.
GGUF model conversions are provided by the audio-cpp community.

